{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-templates-post-tsx","path":"/blog/5070b352-0fe6-5a5a-a1e2-65a8ef238804/","result":{"data":{"post":{"frontmatter":{"date":"02 May 2025","title":"We saved our customer more than $50k on hype-driven ChatGPT v4 integration, by using a self-hosted Machine Learning model","text":"One of our clients was about to drop $50,000+ on a flashy AI integration.All they really needed was a way to organize thousands of customer messages and migrate messy data. But everyone was telling them: “Just use GPT-4.”","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/c7240/50kenginst.png","srcSet":"/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/de3a1/50kenginst.png 150w,\n/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/30cdc/50kenginst.png 300w,\n/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/c7240/50kenginst.png 600w","sizes":"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/81307/50kenginst.avif 150w,\n/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/aa5b9/50kenginst.avif 300w,\n/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/0c8d0/50kenginst.avif 600w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/c65bc/50kenginst.webp 150w,\n/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/078c3/50kenginst.webp 300w,\n/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/6d09e/50kenginst.webp 600w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw"}]},"width":600,"height":600}}},"keywords":["ChatGPTintegration","AI","automatization","ML","datamigration","Hubspot"],"canonicalUrl":""},"html":"<h2>We saved our customer more than $50k on hype-driven ChatGPT v4 integration, by using a self-hosted Machine Learning model</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/302a4/50kenginst.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 100%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"self-hosted Machine Learning model\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/fcda8/50kenginst.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/12f09/50kenginst.png 148w,\n/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/e4a3f/50kenginst.png 295w,\n/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/fcda8/50kenginst.png 590w,\n/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/efc66/50kenginst.png 885w,\n/static/97aa7f6539ebfa733c2f7c005760f6d2/302a4/50kenginst.png 1080w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>One of our clients was about to drop $50,000+ on a flashy AI integration.<br/><br/>\nAll they really needed was a way to organize thousands of customer messages and migrate messy data. But everyone was telling them:<br/><br/>\n“Just use GPT-4.”<br/><br/>\n“It’s the new standard.”<br/><br/>\n“It’ll do everything.”<br/><br/>\nSounds great — until you look at the cost, complexity, and what you actually need.</p>\n<p>😎 So we did it differently.<br/><br/>\n<strong>We built a custom, self-hosted ML solution tailored to their business, not someone else's hype.</strong>\n✅ Trained it on public competitor data<br/><br/>\n✅ Used AI to automatically sort and structure everything during migration<br/><br/>\n✅ Analyzed emails, calls, and chats to find real customer insights<br/><br/></p>\n<p><strong>🔑 The result?</strong><br/><br/>\n💰 $50,000+ saved<br/><br/>\n📦 No more manual tagging or messy data<br/><br/>\n🔐 Total privacy and control<br/><br/>\n📊 Actionable insights that helped the business grow<br/><br/></p>\n<p><strong>Now we're curious…</strong>\nAre you integrating AI — or just being told you should?\nHave you ever gone against the trend and found a better, smarter solution?</p>\n<p>We’d love to hear your take. 👇\n<strong>We wish you a great mood and interesting tasks!</strong></p>","wordCount":{"words":194}},"author":{"frontmatter":{"authorAlias":"Zakruzhnaya","author":"Olga Zakruzhnaya","authorPosition":"Marketing specialist","authorPhoto":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/906692340e07de91d933684326227c1c/d4a57/author.jpg","srcSet":"/static/906692340e07de91d933684326227c1c/40657/author.jpg 16w,\n/static/906692340e07de91d933684326227c1c/77b35/author.jpg 32w,\n/static/906692340e07de91d933684326227c1c/d4a57/author.jpg 64w,\n/static/906692340e07de91d933684326227c1c/19e71/author.jpg 128w","sizes":"(min-width: 64px) 64px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/906692340e07de91d933684326227c1c/e8e20/author.avif 16w,\n/static/906692340e07de91d933684326227c1c/b6d61/author.avif 32w,\n/static/906692340e07de91d933684326227c1c/2e71d/author.avif 64w,\n/static/906692340e07de91d933684326227c1c/3c49f/author.avif 128w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 64px) 64px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/906692340e07de91d933684326227c1c/e789a/author.webp 16w,\n/static/906692340e07de91d933684326227c1c/ef6ff/author.webp 32w,\n/static/906692340e07de91d933684326227c1c/8257c/author.webp 64w,\n/static/906692340e07de91d933684326227c1c/6766a/author.webp 128w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 64px) 64px, 100vw"}]},"width":64,"height":64}}}}}},"pageContext":{"id":"5070b3